cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "cold-start-leakage: companion code for Cold-Start Attack"
abstract: >-
  Simulation framework measuring how much of a private account's social
  neighbourhood a cold-start observer can recover from ordinary top-k
  recommendations, and evaluating candidate defences against static and
  adaptive attackers.
